# The migrations are embedded in the app and checked byte for byte against
# what each school's database already applied (sqlx stores a SHA-384 of each
# file). core.autocrlf is on for this PC, so without this a checkout could
# rewrite them with CRLF line endings and every school's app would refuse to
# open after the next update. Always LF, whatever the machine's settings.
src-tauri/migrations/*.sql text eol=lf
